# Byte-pinned text artifact under test: harness-daemon's grammar.rs
# byte-compares include_str!("grammar.json") against serde_json's
# \n-serialized output, so a CRLF checkout (git autocrlf on Windows,
# the CI runner default) must not rewrite its line endings. eol=lf
# overrides autocrlf on every platform; the committed blob is LF.
# (Same discipline as harness-media/.gitattributes for binary fixtures.)
harness-daemon/src/grammar.json text eol=lf

# Byte-pinned test fixture: harness-daemon's plan_mode_tests
# byte-compare a freshly driven transcript against the committed
# task16_golden_session_transcript.json via read_to_string (Rust does
# no newline translation), so a CRLF checkout (git autocrlf on Windows,
# the CI runner default) must not rewrite its line endings. eol=lf
# overrides autocrlf on every platform; the committed blobs are LF.
# (Same discipline as grammar.json above, commit c836542.)
harness-daemon/tests/fixtures/** text eol=lf
